{"title":"2009 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/c/edcc8ed333ab8cc506d830591fd55742c15ecafb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{10^{2} - 10}{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"72\" height=\"41\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/e/62ec383d475b1419a55e708b9e14bb27d1622f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 10 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 1 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 7 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 2009 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"433\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Following <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Order_of_operations\" title=\"Order of operations\">order of operations</a>, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/7/207c58292af0e381efa3e97d31b82089e7166e23.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{10^{2} - 10}{9} = \\frac{100 - 10}{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"168\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/2/db2539612502e055a59063a5cb9a2ec43c6a2c11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{90}{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"43\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/4/224e5d120eb3b0267b38a914aa5893034a070d5d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } 10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"86\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/8/1d8aa085949fb7b28d5e42ac6f4d5e169e08ba77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^{2} - 10 = 10 \\times 10 - 10 \\times 1 = 10 \\times (10 - 1) = 10 \\times 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"424\" height=\"21\" />, which means that:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/8/f28714017d7163016c02432b345924894532ec84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{10^{2} - 10}{9} = \\frac{10 \\times 9}{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"150\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>The <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />s cancel out in the numerator and the denominator, so we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/7/f17d0d1b531b0d22a9507903146910096e6d2d46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } 10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"67\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_2\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Lgnjqr28Lnk\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Lgnjqr28Lnk</a> (also includes problems 2-10)\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Cayley\" title=\"2009 CEMC Cayley\">2009 CEMC Cayley</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Cayley_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2009 CEMC Cayley Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Cayley_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2009 CEMC Cayley Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2009 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2009 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2009 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2009 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2009 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2009 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2009 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2009 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" titl